ortant  characters might be dead but you know  would not die because he is too  important to the story and we know that  yuki Tabata does not like killing  important characters i mean just look at  what happened with julius it turns out  that along with you know Klaus and  L'Etoile are also safe which is good  because I didn't want to lose my waifu  with glasses and no I don't mean Klaus I  mean the other one but even though we  didn't lose the major characters only  the minor ones we still can't under  state the importance of the fact that  half of the Golden Dawn members really  did die and we're still not too sure  about what happened to William so while  those of us who were worried about you  know and L'Etoile and I guess Klaus can  let out a sigh of relief these events  that just took place are going to have a  profound influence on the story don't  forget that you know is the vice-captain  of the Golden Dawn and that he feels  directly responsible for the safety of  his comrades it turns out that he was  not strong enough to protect them he  failed to defeat xenon and as a result  many of his comrades perished no matter  what happens now you know will never be  the same again we can already see that  he has changed he is more emotional and  agitated than he has ever been and I am  certain that from this point onward you  know will be driven by a desire to  avenge his comrades and destroy xenon  and the dark triad this means that you  know we'll be more motivated than ever  to keep getting stronger but it also  means that you no could let emotion get  the better of him in crucial moments so  he could end up making bad decisions  because he is so bent on getting revenge  instead of thinking strategically and  retreating when he realizes that he has  no chance of winning you know might let  anger get the best of him and this could  put his life in danger in the coming  chapters and speaking of danger the end  of this chapter has made it clear that  the world of 