  special interest to Dante and the dark  triad dark magic is able to absorb other  spells and dark magic is also capable of  cutting through spatial magic which was  thought to be impossible but most  importantly dark magic is the only known  magic type that isn't directly connected  to demonic power but still has an effect  on otherworldly demonic beings such as  the kotodama demon during the fight  against the kotodama demon we saw that  hasta Santa magic had an effect on the  demon because it comes from another  demon but most magic types from this  world did not have an effect on the  kotodama demon however for some reason  Yami's dark magic did have an effect and  Yami actually played a critically  important role in ultimately defeating  the kotodama demon this might be the  reason why Dante is so interested in  Yami since we know that the dark triad  relies on demonic power  Yami's dark magic could pose a major  threat to their power as we know demons  are not immune to dark magic and if used  properly dark magic could deal  significant damage to even the strongest  of the demons  it is possible that Dante wants to  take Yami down before Yami has the  chance to use his dark magic to its  fullest potential the true nature of  dark magic is still a pretty big mystery  in black clover we know that it is  extremely rare and we know that it has  some very unique properties but we still  don't know why exactly dark magic is so  rare and so unique there could be some  hidden connection between Yami and his  dark magic and the demons and their  power a connection that gives Yami a  powerful advantage over the demons we  will have to wait and see what happens  but it is clear to me that Total War is  finally here you know has changed as a  character and he will never be the same  the dark triad is on the move and  preparing to deal a massive blow to the  clover heart alliance and we are about  to be blessed with a truly epic showdown  between the leader of the dark tr